From 31dc8991e0f1bbdc4004fbf82a33903a977e23c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:40:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 858/913] module: stm32_opp: check elt_id_to_ctx() for NULL in
 element_init
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

stm32_opp_element_init() dereferenced the result of elt_id_to_ctx()
without checking for NULL, unlike every other call site in this
file, causing a NULL pointer dereference for an invalid element_id.

Return FWK_E_PARAM when ctx is NULL.

Coverity issue: CID 1200596: CERT-C Expression

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git dfc9ca8fa40ce59dfbfa770137118ae783fc003a module: stm32_opp: check elt_id_to_ctx() for NULL in element_init]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Ib5224bce2f84f2585315e9a5584a7e1688ee19dd
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/SCP-firmware/+/592833
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
---
 .../optee/stm32mp2/module/stm32_opp/src/mod_stm32_opp.c       | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/stm32mp2/module/stm32_opp/src/mod_stm32_opp.c b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/stm32mp2/module/stm32_opp/src/mod_stm32_opp.c
index e93953d03..3636763f0 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/stm32mp2/module/stm32_opp/src/mod_stm32_opp.c
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/stm32mp2/module/stm32_opp/src/mod_stm32_opp.c
@@ -241,6 +241,10 @@ static int stm32_opp_element_init(fwk_id_t element_id, unsigned int dev_count,
     struct stm32_opp_dev_ctx *ctx = elt_id_to_ctx(element_id);
     const struct mod_stm32_opp_config *config = data;
 
+    if (ctx == NULL) {
+        return FWK_E_PARAM;
+    }
+
     ctx->opp_id = config->opp_id;
 
     return FWK_SUCCESS;
-- 
2.53.0

